---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import SEO from "../components/SEO.astro";

const updated = "19 August 2026";
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo.png" />
    <SEO
      title="Privacy Policy | TheArkTech"
      description="How TheArkTech handles your information when you visit thearktech.in or contact us about a project."
      url="https://thearktech.in/privacy"
      image="https://thearktech.in/banner.png"
      siteName="TheArkTech"
      keywords={[]}
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-bg text-ink">
    <Nav />
    <main class="legal-page">
      <div class="container-x legal-content">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="font-display legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <section>
          <h2>1. The short version</h2>
          <p>
            thearktech.in is a static website. It has no user accounts, does not set
            tracking cookies of its own, and does not store your data on our servers when
            you browse it. The only personal information we receive is what you choose to
            send us when you contact us.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. What we collect and why</h2>
          <p>
            When you reach out through the contact options on this site — WhatsApp, email,
            or phone — we receive the details you include, typically your name, contact
            information, and a description of your project. We use this only to respond to
            your enquiry, prepare quotes, and deliver services you engage us for. We do
            not sell your information or share it with third parties for marketing.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. WhatsApp and email</h2>
          <p>
            Our contact and booking buttons open WhatsApp (or your email app) with a
            pre-filled message. Nothing is sent until you press send in that app.
            Conversations held on WhatsApp are also subject to
            <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp's privacy policy</a>;
            email is handled by your and our email providers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. How long we keep information</h2>
          <p>
            We keep enquiry and project correspondence for as long as needed to serve you
            and to meet legal and accounting obligations, then delete it. You can ask us
            to delete your correspondence at any time (see Contact below), unless we are
            required to retain it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Third-party links</h2>
          <p>
            Our portfolio links to client websites and our pages may link to external
            services. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which we do not
            control.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            You may request a copy of the personal information we hold about you, ask us
            to correct it, or ask us to delete it. We comply with applicable Indian data
            protection law, including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For any privacy question or request, email
            <a href="mailto:contact@thearktech.in">contact@thearktech.in</a> or message us
            on <a href="https://wa.me/919489722142" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 8rem 0 5rem;
    min-height: 60svh;
  }
  .legal-content {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .legal-updated {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .legal-content section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: "Clash Display", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--brand-bright);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
